  "name": "booty-hunt",
  "description": "Booty Hunt is a high-performance 3D nautical roguelike built with Three.js and a Rust-based backend for asynchronous social mechanics. The engine features advanced procedural systems for world generation, real-time maritime combat, and a unique Web Audio-driven procedural shanty synthesizer. It implements a robust telemetry and replay infrastructure to support competitive ghost-fleet leaderboards and persistent world events.",
